        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 20</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gest hine clænsie sylfes aþe on wiofode; swylce cyninges ðe[gn].</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A stranger should clear himself with his own oath at the altar; similarly the king’s thegn.</ab>
